          <change when="2020-05-24T06:29:18-04:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/james.cowey">General - In the reprint of O.Wilcken from 1970 there are corrections collected by P.J. Sijpesteijn and made at the end of the volume. On p. 437 (https://archive.org/details/griechischeostra02wilc/page/436/mode/2up) one finds the correction to 288. Indeed on the image now available from the British Library it is clear that Ἱππολύτ(ου) is a better reading.</change>
